int n, c[maxn], par[maxn], sz[maxn];
ll x, y, w[maxn], fact[maxn], invFact[maxn];
map<int, int> colorCount[maxn];
vector<pair<ll, int> > colors[maxn];
set<pair<ll, int> > picker;

ll powmod(ll a, ll b) {
	if (b == 0) {
		return 1;
	}
	ll tmp = powmod(a, b / 2);
	tmp = tmp * tmp % mod;
	if (b & 1) {
		tmp = tmp * a % mod;
	}
	return tmp;
}

int find(int u) {
	return (par[u] == u ? u : par[u] = find(par[u]));
}

void merge(int u, int v) {
	u = find(u);
	v = find(v);
	if (u == v) {
		return;
	}
	if (colorCount[u].size() < colorCount[v].size()) {
		swap(u, v);
	}
	for (pair<int, int> i : colorCount[v]) {
		colorCount[u][i.ff] += i.ss;
	}
	sz[u] += sz[v];
	par[v] = u;
}

void handle(int a, int b) {
	if (a == b) {
		return;
	}

	if (c[a] == c[b]) {
		if (w[a] + w[b] <= x) {
			merge(a, b);
		}
	}
	else {
		if (w[a] + w[b] <= y) {
			merge(a, b);
		}
	}
}

void handleAll(int x) {
	for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {
		handle(x, i);
	}
}

int main()
{
	ios_base::sync_with_stdio(false);
	cin.tie(0);

	for (int i = 0; i < maxn; i++) {
		par[i] = i;
		sz[i] = 1;
		fact[i] = (i ? fact[i - 1] * i % mod : 1);
		invFact[i] = powmod(fact[i], mod - 2);
	}

	cin >> n >> x >> y;
	for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {
		cin >> c[i] >> w[i];
		colors[c[i]].pb(mp(w[i], i));
		colorCount[i][c[i]] = 1;
	}

	for (int i = 0; i < maxn; i++) {
		sort(all(colors[i]));

		if (!colors[i].empty()) {
			picker.insert(colors[i][0]);
			for (int j = 1; j < colors[i].size(); j++) {
				handle(colors[i][0].ss, colors[i][j].ss);
			}
		}
	}

	if (picker.size() > 1) {
		auto it = picker.begin();
		handleAll(it->ss);
		it++;
		handleAll(it->ss);
	}

	ll ans = 1;
	for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {
		if (par[i] == i) {
			ans = ans * fact[sz[i]] % mod;
			for (pair<int, int> extra : colorCount[i]) {
				ans = ans * invFact[extra.ss] % mod;
			}
		}
	}
	cout << ans << endl;
}

